    → should import the new SerializerConfig interface and/or SerializerConfigImpl class.

2. Field declaration  
  • Line 55:  
    private final Supplier<ExecutionConfig> executionConfig;  
    → rename to  
      private final Supplier<SerializerConfig> serializerConfig;

3. Constructor signature and assignment  
